# 🛰️ Orbital Sentinel — ISS Live Tracker

> 3D ISS tracking and orbital safety monitoring platform.


👉 ## 🚀 Live Demo

🔗 https://orbital-sentinel.netlify.app/

## 📌 About

Orbital Sentinel is a web-based prototype for visualizing the International Space Station in 3D and monitoring nearby simulated orbital objects.

## ✨ Features

- 🌍 Interactive 3D Earth
- 🛰️ Live ISS tracking
- 📡 ISS telemetry
- 🌀 Orbital trajectory visualization
- ☄️ Simulated space-debris monitoring
- ⚠️ Conjunction risk visualization
- 🤖 ARIA mission assistant
- 🌐 Live web deployment

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Three.js
- Where The ISS API
- Netlify

## ⚠️ Prototype Limitation

The current debris and conjunction monitoring system is a simulation prototype. It is intended to demonstrate the concept and is not a production collision-avoidance system.

## 🎯 Hackathon

Built as a prototype for an ISS 3D tracking and orbital safety challenge.